WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Open a project to see the preview and timeline.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Play the preview to review zooms and local emphasis.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Click the timeline to stop at the moment you want to edit.

4
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Split at the playhead to edit each clip independently.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Undo the last step to restore the clip before the split.

6
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Select a zoom segment and fine-tune its magnification.

7
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Open Export to check the resolution and frame rate.

